index ea3f8e8902317050c0cd04acf78923145b1da6cc..afd75109ac0557a7df593f07424a8bd3aa00aa62 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -5,6 +5,27 @@ Versioning for the complete specification set.
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+### Added
+
+- Unreleased, opt-in core manifest schema 9 adds optional
+  `dependencies.skills.*.directory` selection at the dependency's pinned
+  repository ref. It reuses the Skillfile schema-2 directory grammar,
+  normalizes omitted directory to `.`, and binds package, closure, lock,
+  local audit and install-marker-v6 identity to that directory. Schemas 1
+  through 8 and the rc.14 suite remain unchanged; the source-extension
+  vectors cover path rejection, missing package folders and manifests, root
+  compatibility, and same-repository diamond unification. Released schemas
+  stay byte-frozen: schema-9 recording mints `install-marker-v6` (marker v5
+  shape with manifest versions through 9) because the frozen marker v5 band
+  cannot record version 9.
+
+### Changed
+
+- Fixture the rc.14 release-gate tests on the published v1.0.0-rc.14 tag
+  instead of the live worktree, so post-tag candidate work no longer fails
+  the frozen rc.14 pin check. Raw blob bytes are restored for
+  export-subst paths.
+
 ## 1.0.0-rc.14 - 2026-10-02
 
 ### Changed
